  "solution": "BODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nGiven equation: 150 – 5 + 3 ÷ 23 × 3 = ?\n\nNow, if ‘+’ means ‘×’, ‘×’ means ‘-’, ‘-’ means ‘÷’ and ‘÷’ means ‘+’, then:\n\n⇒ __**150 **____**÷ 5**__** **× 3 + 23 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30 **____**× 3**__ + 23 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**90 + 23**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**113 - 3**__ = **110**\n\nHence, the correct is **\"Option 4\".**",
